><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.5%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_DeMsZxpOHkeeF4zhh9GPeQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_NonrelatedPartyMember_fYFs5_JmT0mH6uArtI2LeQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="zh:CurrentLiabilitiesForAdrReimbursement" scale="3" id="Tc_hGmP49ORXkysYQ-7iRnfbQ_9_4">43,513</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:76.13%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Others</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.41%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.52%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_DeMsZxpOHkeeF4zhh9GPeQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_NonrelatedPartyMember_0cXiIOCY6EKPWR6zLWRI0Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:OtherSundryLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="3" id="Tc_KoYCFRJiwU-d39_bTZilBg_10_2">7,051</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.41%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.5%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_DeMsZxpOHkeeF4zhh9GPeQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_NonrelatedPartyMember_fYFs5_JmT0mH6uArtI2LeQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:OtherSundryLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="3" id="Tc_jVDsUrcl_0aUHdPeu-Gd3Q_10_4">4,152</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:76.13%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Total</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.41%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.52%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_DeMsZxpOHkeeF4zhh9GPeQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2022_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_NonrelatedPartyMember_0cXiIOCY6EKPWR6zLWRI0Q" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:OtherLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="3" id="Tc_Wsloa4R32U2Vk-55SH_F7g_11_2">165,531</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:2.41%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:9.5%;border-bottom:3px double #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_DeMsZxpOHkeeF4zhh9GPeQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2023_us-gaap_RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis_us-gaap_NonrelatedPartyMember_fYFs5_JmT0mH6uArtI2LeQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:OtherLiabilitiesCurrent" scale="3" id="Tc_hZ-MM9zE-USkQxXpZt3TMg_11_4">171,743</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_DcETGNWS5E-h-IMlQz75OA" name="zh:ContractLiabilitiesDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_sRfTNu8yQEasl6UsCK4mMw" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">11.&#160;&#160;Contract Liabilities</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Contract liabilities primarily relate to the payments received for advertising services, paid content services, content-commerce solutions and vocational training in advance of revenue recognition. The increase in contract liabilities over the prior year was a result of the increase in consideration received from the Group&#8217;s customers, which was in line with the growth of revenues in content-commerce solutions, paid membership service and vocational training. Due to the generally short-term duration of the relevant contracts, the majority of the performance obligations are satisfied within one year. The amount of revenue recognized that was included in the contract liabilities balance at the beginning of the year was RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_DeMsZxpOHkeeF4zhh9GPeQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_Qw0QLa0eGUiVHby0Rl_kVg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiabilityRevenueRecognized" scale="6" id="Narr_FF410CcvhkGDKF-3kYXYeQ">138.6</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million, RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_DeMsZxpOHkeeF4zhh9GPeQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_12_31_2022_PQoX-sHfkECXOZ3XOpPhsA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiabilityRevenueRecognized" scale="6" id="Narr_2FD0rzMuD0KS_cCvw1Z8GA">215.5</ix:nonFraction>&#160;million and RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_DeMsZxpOHkeeF4zhh9GPeQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_DcETGNWS5E-h-IMlQz75OA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ContractWithCustomerLiabilityRevenueRecognized" scale="6" id="Narr_5K_3hVI-i0W1dUCa6oGYAA">319.3</ix:nonFraction> million for the&#160;years ended December 31, 2021, 2022 and 2023, respectively.</p></ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2023_To_12_31_2023_DcETGNWS5E-h-IMlQz75OA" name="zh:OrdinarySharesTextBlock" id="Tb_agew9cPOGEGOTn_dlqveeg" continuedAt="Tb_agew9cPOGEGOTn_dlqveeg_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">12.&#160;&#160;Ordinary Shares</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company was incorporated on May&#160;17, 2011 with an authorized share capital of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_KfXEtaieV025kfWfh3EteA" contextRef="As_Of_5_17_2011_MJX0IXWQqECAUON4Rzlc0A" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="zh:CommonStockValuesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_zEvntYgztkylj-s6Jr78LQ">50,000</ix:nonFraction> divided into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="As_Of_5_17_2011_MJX0IXWQqECAUON4Rzlc0A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_IXd85mqH-0qv0p5YCF63UA">50,000</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_KPMNKFLDU0yvPOvG0dsyGA" contextRef="As_Of_5_17_2011_MJX0IXWQqECAUON4Rzlc0A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_HBiKCxfYYUen9v6h5LhS7Q">1</ix:nonFraction> each, of which <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="As_Of_5_17_2011_MJX0IXWQqECAUON4Rzlc0A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_DAl3qLgk-0yHBQ0MQUfewQ">10</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares had been issued. Zhihu Holdings&#160;Inc. and Innovation Works Holdings Limited, companies organized under the laws of the British Virgin Islands, held <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_g-zIRJGZLUuwaEmPAMvOqA" contextRef="Duration_5_17_2011_To_5_17_2011_dei_LegalEntityAxis_zh_ZhihuHoldingsIncMember_Hg8fnl5fEEaZ-CGWXUkJiQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="zh:PercentageOfTotalEquities" scale="-2" id="Narr_88ZT-Ri30kyqIdCfJPTktQ">80</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_g-zIRJGZLUuwaEmPAMvOqA" contextRef="Duration_5_17_2011_To_5_17_2011_dei_LegalEntityAxis_zh_InnovationWorksHoldingsLimitedMember_KUTJQlTwNkOM2p1TxJT7-w" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="zh:PercentageOfTotalEquities" scale="-2" id="Narr_FNclmAzyi064aAlbAvV7Gw">20</ix:nonFraction>% of total equities of the Company, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">After several issuances, share splits and repurchases of certain shares held by investors prior to 2019, the Company had <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2018_MCR0d49nZkCkXRpZhYrkxQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_xyHZaH7MN0eTEYwQYCgltg">58,808,070</ix:nonFraction> of ordinary shares issued and <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_ATTXFu2wek6EYwTrN2PkYA;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">outstanding</span></span> as of December&#160;31, 2018.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In March 2021, the Company completed the IPO. Immediately prior to the completion of the IPO, the Company&#8217;s authorized share capital was changed into US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_KfXEtaieV025kfWfh3EteA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2021_h32fTx36sUSCUOLui9Qv0A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="zh:CommonStockValuesAuthorized" scale="3" id="Narr_35JesFJFQky4YadPAlXZ7A">200,000</ix:nonFraction> divided into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2021_h32fTx36sUSCUOLui9Qv0A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_8Ini5OegzEWkMhglmCsxaQ">1,600,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares comprising (i) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_oRXLMOaN0Ey1nBQ9HaiayQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_8dFoBDezJUWBjXnPCDe5Fw">1,500,000,000</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares of a par value of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_KPMNKFLDU0yvPOvG0dsyGA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_oRXLMOaN0Ey1nBQ9HaiayQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_pElbRFnALU2C4VqSJIEQRw">0.000125</ix:nonFraction> each, (ii)<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassBMember_cRVSUfSFXU6tr8wtk4Lstw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_1_YheSm3P0K3Tn3H8t8cBg">50,000,000</ix:nonFraction> Class B ordinary shares of a par value of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_KPMNKFLDU0yvPOvG0dsyGA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassBMember_cRVSUfSFXU6tr8wtk4Lstw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_nNu4YXQEyUe2jWCOWxur9A">0.000125</ix:nonFraction> each, and (iii) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_zh_DesignatedOrdinarySharesMember_b3Exe1k3vEaacf7ngYxz3g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_IKP7s9wq20mfX0gqmqyTxQ">50,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of a par value of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_KPMNKFLDU0yvPOvG0dsyGA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_zh_DesignatedOrdinarySharesMember_b3Exe1k3vEaacf7ngYxz3g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_uUulJ-WqP0-T8Mg_k0CCSg">0.000125</ix:nonFraction> each of such class or classes (however designated) as the board of directors may determine in accordance with the Company&#8217;s post-offering memorandum and articles of association. Immediately prior to the completion of the IPO, all of the Company&#8217;s issued and outstanding preferred shares and ordinary shares were converted into, and re-designated and re-classified, as Class A ordinary shares on a one-for-one basis, except that the <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2021_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_us-gaap_MajorityShareholderMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassBMember_74pPfDb2UUGaohjhGxXITQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesIssued" scale="0" id="Narr_Wg-qRe1s0UmdMy4WYoqIgA">19,227,592</ix:nonFraction> <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_Nr0lacKvEEyMc_CXjlifEQ;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">shares</span></span> beneficially owned by Mr. Yuan Zhou continue to be Class B ordinary shares.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the IPO, the Company sold a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2021_To_3_31_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_IPOMember_9LKodjWzW0eehnMu5M_jSw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_OkFHW3pm4UOjDsYSy9KGlg">55,000,000</ix:nonFraction> ADSs, with <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2021_To_3_31_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_IPOMember_9LKodjWzW0eehnMu5M_jSw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="zh:NumberOfAdssRepresentingOneClassOrdinaryShare" scale="0" id="Narr_B0sZQSaYLEOs08FHhHUwrQ">two</ix:nonFraction> ADSs representing one Class A ordinary share of the Company with par value of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_KPMNKFLDU0yvPOvG0dsyGA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_IPOMember_A2TiteOKIUq2gdckPERY6Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_g2WaCpNvqEue95TveP1Vag">0.000125</ix:nonFraction> per share. In addition, the Company sold and issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2021_To_3_31_2021_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_PrivatePlacementMember_hNk52SswWESRJhLEONdnIw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_QoPs9tMD60-rJIr6tmnVFg">13,157,892</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares in the concurrent private placements to certain investors based on the IPO price of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_KPMNKFLDU0yvPOvG0dsyGA" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_IPOMember_A2TiteOKIUq2gdckPERY6Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:SharesIssuedPricePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_LlPioKxOnUWyHVBa2gk5hQ">9.50</ix:nonFraction> per ADS. The Company received a total of approximately US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_KfXEtaieV025kfWfh3EteA" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2021_To_3_31_2021_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_IPOMember_jV4PFFiyLEW513r2BXbbkQ" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="zh:NetProceedsAfterDeductingUnderwritingCommissions" scale="6" id="Narr_9j8SaKqskEiIAnfIlzxiKw">737.1</ix:nonFraction> million (RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_DeMsZxpOHkeeF4zhh9GPeQ" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2021_To_3_31_2021_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_IPOMember_jV4PFFiyLEW513r2BXbbkQ" decimals="-8" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="zh:NetProceedsAfterDeductingUnderwritingCommissions" scale="9" id="Narr_VdaJAknFaUSNJZNShCrrYg">4.8</ix:nonFraction> billion) of net proceeds after deducting the underwriter commissions and relevant offering expenses.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-39</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Zhihu&#160;Inc.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">NOTES&#160;TO THE CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&#160;(Continued)</p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_agew9cPOGEGOTn_dlqveeg_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">12.&#160;&#160;Ordinary Shares (Continued)</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In April 2021, the underwriters exercised their option to purchase <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2021_To_4_30_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_OverAllotmentOptionMember_kAUiqBY130GKgv9O7mplJA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_DrSDBX7AqEecnrXaGS1STg">259,904</ix:nonFraction> additional ADSs and the Company received a total of approximately US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_KfXEtaieV025kfWfh3EteA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2021_To_4_30_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_OverAllotmentOptionMember_kAUiqBY130GKgv9O7mplJA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="zh:NetProceedsAfterDeductingUnderwritingCommissions" scale="6" id="Narr_tuuAQyvEIU64aOm3VePT2Q">2.3</ix:nonFraction> million (RMB<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_CNY_DeMsZxpOHkeeF4zhh9GPeQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2021_To_4_30_2021_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis_us-gaap_OverAllotmentOptionMember_kAUiqBY130GKgv9O7mplJA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="zh:NetProceedsAfterDeductingUnderwritingCommissions" scale="6" id="Narr_7hHivtKKHESiWqNQl6fiGQ">15.1</ix:nonFraction> million) of net proceeds after deducting the underwriter commissions.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">In June 2022, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="Duration_6_1_2022_To_6_30_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_jRaVgGKaekWNp_DEXYtJ6w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="zh:NumberOfSharesDesignated" scale="0" id="Narr_Ac2IoitDR0mamClkbJa0rw">50,000,000</ix:nonFraction> shares were designated as Class A ordinary shares of a par value of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_KPMNKFLDU0yvPOvG0dsyGA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_c9NAHOMrpEW476yDDOkDCQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_q7rlNkXUcEieMzhtONI6gw">0.000125</ix:nonFraction> each. As a result, the Company had <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2022_iiZUHqckfUa6BNp49l_90Q" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_69b-7qJ1g0uqCAjalJK3HA">1,600,000,000</ix:nonFraction> authorized shares in total, comprising (i) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_c9NAHOMrpEW476yDDOkDCQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_F_Mkm78w40GsT_71HwiZuQ">1,550,000,000</ix:nonFraction> Class A ordinary shares of a par value of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_KPMNKFLDU0yvPOvG0dsyGA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassAMember_c9NAHOMrpEW476yDDOkDCQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_T0HG4LUvG0WcfKN0IBZGSQ">0.000125</ix:nonFraction> each, (ii) <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_vdwZja7J9U2U8FOkt8QJ6w" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassBMember_qA0ye_AuzU-1kQYYMllY4A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="0" id="Narr_GxwZl33-xUujoEQWRB-_9g">50,000,000</ix:nonFraction> Class B ordinary shares of a par value of US$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_KPMNKFLDU0yvPOvG0dsyGA" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_us-gaap_CommonClassBMember_qA0ye_AuzU-1kQYYMllY4A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockParOrStatedValuePerShare" scale="0" id="Narr_JgPPBpN5k0m4ZYIQCD5Tjw">0.000125</ix:nonFraction> each.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="_0d441e19_a734_418a_b701_abff60baa9da"></a><a id="Tc_p5FlGFhhhUWIN0GPHryK_w_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_DkLsqHG4SkWDFvUFPZEeIA_1_6"></a><a id="Tc_79lvYuXpok6LfH4nk37znA_2_0"></a><a id="Tc_hX22BWz8I0Wh64S_UEgCUg_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_FhrWi3JrBkW8GDMkSwD_Fw_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_0kxMeJcav0ST-Ikz22vn5Q_2_6"></a><a id="Tc_m88bMHg2YkyyKqKwQoG7VQ_3_6"></a><a id="Tc_HUjuJd0r2UCWahHFLi1jdQ_